err-disabled = 🚧 This platform is temporarily disabled.
err-private = 🔒 This content is private and can't be downloaded.
err-notfound = 🗑 Content not found or deleted.
err-age = 🔞 Age-restricted content can't be downloaded.
err-toolarge = 📦 The file is too large.
